    "description": "JAG-34 (Just Another Glock) Frame: Laffs\n\n\"Just Another Glock\" frame. For those that just need a basic frame. Not meant to stand out, simple as it comes.\n\nPart of the JAG Pistol Frame line, utilizes Glock 34 length compatible slides; with the frame utilizing Glock 17 sized magazines. \n\nBig boi gun for big boi shootouts.\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C\nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Perimeters: 7+ \nInfill: 80%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 18%\n\n\n\nParts list and assembly instructions are identical with the DD17.2, (Just a longer slide and barrel.) and can be found here:\n\nOdysee: https://odysee.com/@TheGatalog-PrintableFramesReceivers:9/FMDA-DD17.2:7\n\n\n\nRails for this frame can be found here: \n\nAves: https://www.avesrails.com/FMDA-DD172-Rail-Kit-_p_28.html\n\n\n\nAccreditations:\n\nProSpaceDog: Used the measurements of his glock clone frame model for this design. ",
